            "Bar service request routed for separate review",
            "Photography and video access needs identified",
            "Music, production, and power needs identified",
            "Floral, decor, and rental load-in needs identified",
            "Cake or specialty food delivery needs identified",
            "Transportation and parking needs identified",
            "Guest-room or getting-ready room needs identified"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "feasibility_decision",
      "title": "Feasibility review and planning decision",
      "guidance": "Keep preliminary planning separate from an authorized venue commitment.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "key": "review_outcome",
          "type": "fields",
